caption: Minimum Drive-Sheet Data
rule: minimum-drive-sheet-data

Any standard GATES Drive sheet must be able to record:

Campaign name and campaign settings.

Source category and active source name.

The canonical order of each active source's Drives.

Any Secondary Choice attached to a Drive.

Active Marks by Drive.

Old Marks, universally or by archived source.

Character points already earned from active and Old Marks.

The Mark Value applied to each Mark or Mark batch whenever Mark Value can change.

Starting Character Value and Prestige Reset Value when relevant.

Prestige Count and other optional Prestige fields when used.

Other character-point awards separately from Drive advancement.
